units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

read_data data.imidazole
include ff.lmp

molecule pre  pre.mol
molecule post post.mol

fix evb all msevb         &
  reaction pre post react.map 2.8 taper 2.4 shells 3 coupling energy/gaussian a 18.448 b 0.0002821 &
  file msevb.json every 1

fix_modify evb energy yes

labelmap atom 1 C1Im  2 NAIm  3 C2Im  4 NCIm  5 C3Im  6 H1Im  7 HNIm  8 H3Im  9 H4Im 10 C1Ih 11 NAIh 12 C2Ih 13 H4Ih 14 HNIh 15 H5Ih
